// curl

^> curl -L https://github.com/HackerOS-Linux-System/HackerDeck/releases/download/v0.3/hackerdeck -o /usr/bin/hackerdeck
^> chmod +x /usr/bin/hackerdeck
^> curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HackerOS-Linux-System/HackerDeck/main/HackerDeck.desktop -o /usr/share/applications/HackerDeck.desktop
